## 2. Rule Engine (Business Logic)

Use the Rule Engine for conditional business logic that may change over time.

### When to Use

- Scoring algorithms (deal scores, match scores)
- Filtering logic (content filtering, relevance)
- Notification triggers (alert conditions)
- Pricing rules (discounts, thresholds)
- Validation rules (input validation)

### Usage

```typescript
import { ruleEngineService, RuleContext } from '../services/rules';

// Evaluate rules
const context: RuleContext = {
  agentId: 'shopping',
  action: 'score-deal',
  userId: 'user-123',
  data: {
    price: 49.99,
    discount: 50,
    category: 'electronics'
  }
};

const result = await ruleEngineService.evaluate(context, 'scoring');

// Access modified values
const dealScore = result.finalContext.data.dealScore;
const dealReason = result.finalContext.data.dealReason;
```

### Creating Rules

```typescript
import { ruleEngineService } from '../services/rules';

await ruleEngineService.createRule({
  name: 'Excellent Deal Threshold',
  category: 'scoring',
  priority: 10,  // Lower = higher priority
  enabled: true,
  conditions: {
    operator: 'and',
    conditions: [
      { field: 'data.discount', operator: 'gte', value: 50 },
      { field: 'data.price', operator: 'lt', value: 100 }
    ]
  },
  actions: [
    { type: 'set_value', target: 'data.dealScore', value: 95 },
    { type: 'set_value', target: 'data.dealReason', value: 'Exceptional discount!' }
  ],
  metadata: { tags: ['shopping', 'deals'] }
});
```

### Available Operators

| Operator | Description | Example |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `eq` | Equal | `{ field: 'status', operator: 'eq', value: 'active' }` |
| `neq` | Not equal | `{ field: 'status', operator: 'neq', value: 'deleted' }` |
| `gt` / `gte` | Greater than (or equal) | `{ field: 'score', operator: 'gte', value: 80 }` |
| `lt` / `lte` | Less than (or equal) | `{ field: 'price', operator: 'lt', value: 100 }` |
| `in` | Value in array | `{ field: 'category', operator: 'in', value: ['tech', 'science'] }` |
| `contains` | Array/string contains | `{ field: 'tags', operator: 'contains', value: 'hot' }` |
| `matches` | Regex match | `{ field: 'email', operator: 'matches', value: '@company.com$' }` |
| `between` | Value between | `{ field: 'price', operator: 'between', value: [10, 100] }` |
| `exists` | Property exists | `{ field: 'userId', operator: 'exists', value: true }` |

### Available Actions

| Action | Description | Example |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `set_value` | Set a field value | `{ type: 'set_value', target: 'data.score', value: 100 }` |
| `multiply` | Multiply a value | `{ type: 'multiply', target: 'data.score', value: 1.5 }` |
| `add` | Add to a value | `{ type: 'add', target: 'data.bonus', value: 10 }` |
| `filter` | Filter array items | `{ type: 'filter', target: 'data.items', params: { status: 'active' } }` |
| `sort` | Sort array | `{ type: 'sort', target: 'data.items', params: { field: 'score', order: 'desc' } }` |
| `limit` | Limit array size | `{ type: 'limit', target: 'data.items', value: 10 }` |
| `abort` | Stop processing | `{ type: 'abort' }` |

