## 3. Feature Flags (Toggles & Rollouts)

Use Feature Flags for feature toggles, A/B tests, and gradual rollouts.

### When to Use

- Enabling/disabling features without deployment
- A/B testing UI variants
- Gradual rollouts (10% → 50% → 100%)
- Kill switches for problematic features
- User-specific targeting

### Usage

```typescript
import { featureFlagService } from '../services/featureFlags';

// Simple check
const isEnabled = await featureFlagService.isEnabled('new_search_algorithm');

// With user context (for targeting/rollouts)
const context = {
  userId: 'user-123',
  email: 'user@example.com',
  attributes: { plan: 'premium', country: 'US' }
};
const result = await featureFlagService.evaluate('dashboard_experiment', context);

if (result.enabled) {
  // New feature
  if (result.variant === 'treatment') {
    // A/B test treatment group
  }
}
```

### Creating Flags

```typescript
import { featureFlagService } from '../services/featureFlags';

// Simple toggle
await featureFlagService.createFlag({
  key: 'ai_generation_enabled',
  name: 'AI Content Generation',
  description: 'Enable AI-powered content generation',
  enabled: true,
  metadata: { tags: ['core', 'ai'] }
});

// Percentage rollout
await featureFlagService.createFlag({
  key: 'new_search_v2',
  name: 'New Search Algorithm V2',
  enabled: true,
  targetingRules: [
    {
      id: 'internal-users',
      priority: 1,
      conditions: [
        { attribute: 'email', operator: 'ends_with', value: '@company.com' }
      ],
      percentage: 100  // 100% of internal users
    },
    {
      id: 'gradual-rollout',
      priority: 2,
      conditions: [],
      percentage: 10  // 10% of everyone else
    }
  ]
});

// A/B test with variants
await featureFlagService.createFlag({
  key: 'dashboard_layout_test',
  name: 'Dashboard Layout A/B Test',
  enabled: true,
  variants: [
    { key: 'control', name: 'Original', weight: 50, payload: { layout: 'classic' } },
    { key: 'treatment', name: 'New Layout', weight: 50, payload: { layout: 'modern' } }
  ],
  defaultVariant: 'control'
});
```

### Toggle a Flag

```typescript
// Enable/disable
await featureFlagService.updateFlag('feature_key', { enabled: false });

// Or toggle
await featureFlagService.toggleFlag('feature_key');
```

