## Database Schema

### BusinessRule

```prisma
model BusinessRule {
  id          String   @id @default(uuid())
  name        String
  description String?
  category    String   // scoring, filtering, validation, etc.
  conditions  Json     // RuleConditionGroup
  actions     Json     // RuleAction[]
  priority    Int      @default(100)
  enabled     Boolean  @default(true)
  startDate   DateTime?
  endDate     DateTime?
  daysOfWeek  Int[]    // 0-6 for scheduling
  version     Int      @default(1)
  tags        String[]
  createdBy   String?
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime @updatedAt
}
```

### FeatureFlag

```prisma
model FeatureFlag {
  id             String   @id @default(uuid())
  key            String   @unique
  name           String
  description    String?
  enabled        Boolean  @default(false)
  targetingRules Json?    // For percentage rollouts
  variants       Json?    // For A/B tests
  defaultVariant String?
  startDate      DateTime?
  endDate        DateTime?
  tags           String[]
  createdAt      DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt      DateTime @updatedAt
}
```

